briefing =
    Although the battle was costly, the Emperor was forced to retreat.  Use this respite from Imperial assault to annihilate the Ordos.  Do not stop until all Ordos are dead and their base destroyed.

    Once a Palace is constructed, Fremen can be summoned and will fight alongside House Atreides.  Use their desert skills wisely.

    Objective: Destroy all forces that oppose you. Good luck.
